00:26:15.200 --> 00:26:16.760
Hey, you're poor.

525
00:26:16.980 --> 00:26:18.840
Well, hey, your mom is dead.

526
00:26:19.020 --> 00:26:20.060
That's what friends do.

527
00:26:20.400 --> 00:26:20.560
Yeah.

528
00:26:21.020 --> 00:26:22.600
So there you go, Toby.

529
00:26:22.880 --> 00:26:24.060
Get some friends.

